{
  "about": [
    "Every defect planted in this course on purpose, and every case planted to be clean.",
    "It is a checkable artifact, not documentation: tests/test_sample_course.py fails the build",
    "if a row names a detector the spec does not list, an artifact this course does not contain,",
    "or a marker that is no longer in the body it claims to be in.",
    "",
    "expectation: 'defect' means the detector should find something here. 'clean' means it should",
    "find nothing, which is the case a detector that fires on everything gets wrong. 'not_covered'",
    "means the sample cannot exercise the detector yet, and says why."
